WEBVTT

00:06:28.238 --> 00:06:30.119
you just feel gross.

00:06:30.143 --> 00:06:32.528
(Laughter)

00:06:32.552 --> 00:06:35.214
So what if we could take this pizza model

00:06:35.238 --> 00:06:38.586
and overlay it on top
of sexuality education?

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.125
A lot of sexuality education
that happens today

00:06:41.149 --> 00:06:44.551
is so influenced by the baseball model,

00:06:44.575 --> 00:06:48.344
and it sets up education that can't help

00:06:48.368 --> 00:06:52.077
but produce unhealthy
sexuality in young people.

00:06:52.101 --> 00:06:54.340
And those young people
become older people.

00:06:54.364 --> 00:06:57.799
But if we could create sexuality education

00:06:57.823 --> 00:07:00.148
that was more like pizza,